  "prefLabel": "Rko 301.02 Continuing Education Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 301.02 Continuing Education Requirements.\n\n(a) In addition to the continuing education requirements imposed upon a person holding the credentials of RSA 91-A:7-a, I, the ombudsman shall, pursuant to RSA 91-A:7-a, IV, annually complete a minimum of 3 hours of continuing legal education courses or other training relevant to the provisions of RSA 91-A.\n\n(b) Courses or training used to fulfill the continuing education requirements of the New Hampshire Bar shall, if relevant, be counted towards fulfillment of the 3 hours of education or training required by RSA 91-A:7-a, IV.\n\nSource. #13922, eff 5-20-24\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rko300.html"
